# The Den is a cave: Gornek stands just inside its mouth, Kzan Thornslash
# "behind me in the Den" (Gornek in Wayward Weapons, 97279), at the back of
# the cave by players' reports (npc 3159), and Mai'ah, the mage trainer, at 42.51,69.04 "near the entrance
# to the Den" (Glyphic Parchment, 98576). The mouth, 42.4,68.6, lies between
# her and Gornek (42.06,68.33) and opens east onto the training grounds; from
# the boars or from Hana'zua a straight line to anyone inside crosses the
# hill, so the steps before each Den visit end at the mouth.
step Training weapons and boars
  tip The weapons lie around the Den and the training grounds; the Mottled Boars roam the whole valley floor.
  kill 3098 quest 788.1
  collect 277653 quest 97279.1
  goto 42.4,68.6 "The Den"

