step To Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Follow the road north from Far Watch Post to Orgrimmar's main gate. The next guide starts in Orgrimmar: Neeru Fireblade takes the cultists' quest, the trainers teach your new ranks, and the zeppelin leaves from the towers outside the gate for Tirisfal Glades and Silverpine Forest. The Barrens come after Silverpine.
  goto 55.6,72.3 "Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength"
